# Dependencies
# uv 在项目内创建 .venv/；pyproject.toml、.python-version 和 uv.lock 才是
# 需要入库的工具链声明，虚拟环境本身随时可由 `uv run` 重建。
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ruff_cache/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Project internals
.claude/
.codex

# Local extraction dependencies and uncommitted source material
node_modules/

# Validation and extraction scripts, dependency manifests and workflows are
# intentionally tracked so the knowledge base can be reproduced and audited.

# Source PDFs and scans (large binary third-party files)
# 受版权保护的源文件一律不入库：仓库只保存书目信息、页数和 SHA-256 供持有者复核，
# 位置见 sources/*/README.md 与 catalog/corpora.json。
*.pdf
sources/**/*.jpg
sources/**/*.jpeg
sources/**/*.png
sources/**/*.jp2
sources/**/*.tif
sources/**/*.tiff
教材相关/
本地pdf参考/
PDF文档资料/

# Local render and extraction scratch files
tmp/
